      "hizbQuarter": 56,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 895,
      "text": "Follow [O Prophet] what is revealed to you from your Lord – none has the right to be worshiped except Him – and turn away from those who associate partners with Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 106,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 141,
      "ruku": 114,
      "hizbQuarter": 56,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 896,
      "text": "If Allah had willed, they would not have associated partners with Him. We have not made you a keeper over them, nor are you their trustee[35].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 141,
      "ruku": 114,
      "hizbQuarter": 56,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 897,
      "text": "Do not revile those whom they supplicate besides Allah, lest they revile Allah out of spite and lack of knowledge. This is how We made the deeds of every people appealing to them. Then to their Lord is their return, and He will inform them of what they used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
