      "hizbQuarter": 56,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 898,
      "text": "They swear by Allah their most solemn oaths that if a sign came to them, they would certainly believe in it. Say [O Prophet], “Signs are only with Allah.” How do you know that even if it came to them, they would still not believe?",
